  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/12/IMG_4250.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>Momo, La f&agrave;brica dels somnis, la tienda de ropa de mujer y complementos en la calle San Blas, 69 de Onda, ha celebrado su particular fiesta para dar la bienvenida a la Navidad, en la que no ha faltado el cava o los dulces de Torrechiva.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festanadalmomofabricasomnis/img_4239.jpg\" alt=\"img_4239\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festanadalmomofabricasomnis/img_4240.jpg\" alt=\"img_4240\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festanadalmomofabricasomnis/img_4243.jpg\" alt=\"img_4243\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festanadalmomofabricasomnis/img_4244.jpg\" alt=\"img_4244\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festanadalmomofabricasomnis/img_4247.jpg\" alt=\"img_4247\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festanadalmomofabricasomnis/img_4249.jpg\" alt=\"img_4249\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festanadalmomofabricasomnis/img_4250.jpg\" alt=\"img_4250\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festanadalmomofabricasomnis/img_4253.jpg\" alt=\"img_4253\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festanadalmomofabricasomnis/img_4255.jpg\" alt=\"img_4255\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d